{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0ef5f845-eeee-8b15-b59e-cfb774792d5b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T10:29:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I call about an animal. A fox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fox, okay. Did you see it near your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Near my house. This morning. Is daylight, not night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In broad daylight, alright. Can you tell me what it looked like? How big was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Small. Like a little dog. Not big dog. Red, orange color. The tail is long, with white at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a red fox, honestly. Was it acting strange at all? Stumbling, or coming toward you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] No. It walk slow in the yard. It look at me. Then it go behind the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Did it seem hurt or sick, any foaming, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I think no. It look okay. Thin, a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what's the address where you saw it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "350 Broadway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "350 Broadway, in the North End. Got it. And I'm sorry, your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leo Mancini."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mr. Mancini, thank you. I'll pass this along to animal control so they have it on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before, I talk with a representative. Another day. He say a letter, I think. B or D? I write it down wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, a letter, B or D. Can you tell me what it was for? Was it a zone, or a form, or a case number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the, the name of the animal officer. Or the section. I don't know. He say B or D, I hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell from here which one he meant, I'm sorry. I'll make a note to have animal control call you back and they can tell you exactly. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one seven five. Perfect. They'll call you back, probably today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today or tomorrow. Okay. And the fox? I do something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just keep a good distance, don't feed it, and keep pets inside for now. If it comes at you or looks sick, call right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Keep distance. No food. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're very welcome, Mr. Mancini. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T10:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good day. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
